-wangying-shi-ws2478204","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangying-shi","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangying-shi:p006","quote":"實","mention_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangying-shi:p006:m0149"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wangying-shi-ws2478204","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangying-shi","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangying-shi:p006","quote":"實","mention_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangying-shi:p006:m0162"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"南史王瑩傳末少子實嗣，並敘尚安吉公主、襲建城公及二府任事。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA","source_assertion_id":"a-nan023-wangying-shi-father","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wangying-shi-ws2478204","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangying-shi","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangying-shi:p005","quote":"十五年，位左光祿大夫、開府儀同三司、丹陽尹。既為公，須開黃合。宅前促，欲買南鄰朱侃半宅。侃懼見侵，貨得錢百萬，瑩乃回合向東。時人為之語曰：「欲向南，錢可貪；遂向東，為黃銅。」及將拜，印工鑄印，六鑄而龜六毀。及成，頭空不實，補而用之。居職六日暴疾薨，諡曰靜恭。","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangying-shi:p005:m0055"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wangying-shi-ws2478204","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangying-shi","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangying-shi:p006","quote":"少子實嗣。起家秘書郎，尚梁武帝女安吉公主，襲爵建城縣公，為新安太守。實從兄來郡，就求告。實與銅錢五十萬，不聽於郡及道散用。從兄密于郡市貨，還都求利。及去郡數十里，實乃知，命追之。呼從兄上岸盤頭，令卒與杖，搏頰乞原，劣得免。後為南康嗣王湘州長史、長沙郡。王三日出禊，實衣冠傾崎，王性方嚴，見之意殊惡。實稱主名謂王曰：「蕭玉志念實，殿下何見憎？」王驚赧即起。後密啟之，因此廢錮。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangying-shi:p006:m0002"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"少子未給數字序，嗣父爵見下句。","human_reviewed":false}},{"id":"fo7_f8v_rmf","label":"梁武帝衍","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"武帝","mention_ids":["c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line061:m0038","c-nanshi-022-wangzhi:p001:m0532","c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p018:m0162","c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p020:m0043","c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p020:m0092","c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p020:m0166","c-nanshi-033-pei-family: