":"c-liangshu-021-wangzhan-wyd:p004:m0068"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"南史王氏傳依同書本紀、宗室傳與時序辨識，未採蕭氏遠祖譜接合。"},{"id":"fo7_f8v_rmf_E","label":"蕭玉志（梁安吉公主，王實妻）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"蕭玉志","mention_ids":["c-nanshi-023-wangying-shi:p006:m0158"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wangying-shi-ws2478204","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangying-shi","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangying-shi:p006","quote":"蕭玉志","mention_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangying-shi:p006:m0158"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"南史王實稱安吉公主名蕭玉志，為梁武帝女；武英殿本名形作蕭玉誌。宋孝武女、蔡約妻之同封安吉公主另人。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"fo7_f8v_rmf","source_assertion_id":"a-nan023-wangying-yuzhi-father","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wangying-shi-ws2478204","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangying-shi","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangying-shi:p006","quote":"少子實嗣。起家秘書郎，尚梁武帝女安吉公主，襲爵建城縣公，為新安太守。實從兄來郡，就求告。實與銅錢五十萬，不聽於郡及道散用。從兄密于郡市貨，還都求利。及去郡數十里，實乃知，命追之。呼從兄上岸盤頭，令卒與杖，搏頰乞原，劣得免。後為南康嗣王湘州長史、長沙郡。王三日出禊，實衣冠傾崎，王性方嚴，見之意殊惡。實稱主名謂王曰：「蕭玉志念實，殿下何見憎？」王驚赧即起。後密啟之，因此廢錮。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangying-shi:p006:m0158","object_person_reference_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangying-shi:p006:r0012"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"王實自言主名蕭玉志，首文具其父為梁武帝。","human_reviewed":false}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wangying-shi-ws2478204","work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangying-shi","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-nanshi-023-wangying-shi:p006:m0158"],"paragraph_ids":["c-nanshi-023-wangying-shi:p006"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangying-shi:p006:m0158","mention_ids":["c-nanshi-023-wangying-shi:p006:m0158"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count